{"seq":3,"slug":"safeguard-reconcile-report","title":"存管对账与监管报送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-license-compliance/customer-fund-safeguard/safeguard-reconcile-report","wordCount":2044,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"存管对账与监管报送\">存管对账与监管报送</h1><p>存管制度的设计意图再正确，如果没有一套能<strong>每天证明它确实成立</strong>的对账机制，它在监管眼里等于不存在。<a href=\"float-safeguard-segregation\">备付金/客户资金隔离存管</a> 给出的足额性要求是「每个营业日、每个币种、每个主体都无缺口」，而证明这件事的唯一方法是把客户资金负债与存管资产两侧独立核算并对齐。</p>\n<p>本篇讲三件事：日终对账的账务模型、差异的分类与响应、以及监管报送的数据口径如何从同一套账本中产出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-对账的三条恒等式\">核心概念：对账的三条恒等式</h2><p>对账不是「比较两个数字是否相等」，而是验证一组恒等式是否在每个核算单元上成立。存管场景下有三条：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>恒等式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>破坏后的典型症状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>客户负债总额 = 存管资产总额</td>\n<td>足额性</td>\n<td>出现缺口，被后续资金滚动掩盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期初 + 本期贷记 − 本期借记 = 期末</td>\n<td>完整性</td>\n<td>漏记交易，账实不符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台交易侧汇总 = 持牌方/银行资金侧汇总</td>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>单边记账，用户余额与资金不匹配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一条是监管最关心的，第二条是会计正确性，第三条是跨系统一致性。三条必须在<strong>同一个核算单元粒度</strong>上成立——核算单元通常定义为「主体 × 币种 × 账户类型」，任何更粗的粒度都会掩盖局部缺口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[日终触发对账] --&gt; B[从交易系统汇总客户负债]&#10;  B --&gt; C[从银行/存管方获取资产余额]&#10;  C --&gt; D{按 主体×币种 分组对齐}&#10;  D --&gt; E{负债 = 资产?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[检查第二条恒等式]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[产生差异记录]&#10;  G --&gt; H{差异是否可由在途/时间差解释?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[标记 timing_difference&lt;br/&gt;次日复核自动关闭]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[标记 unexplained&lt;br/&gt;进入人工调查队列]&#10;  F --&gt; K{跨系统汇总一致?}&#10;  K --&gt;|否| L[标记单边记账&lt;br/&gt;触发交易回溯]&#10;  K --&gt;|是| M[对账通过 → 写入日报]&#10;  M --&gt; N[按口径生成监管报送]\">graph TD\n  A[日终触发对账] --&gt; B[从交易系统汇总客户负债]\n  B --&gt; C[从银行/存管方获取资产余额]\n  C --&gt; D{按 主体×币种 分组对齐}\n  D --&gt; E{负债 = 资产?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[检查第二条恒等式]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[产生差异记录]\n  G --&gt; H{差异是否可由在途/时间差解释?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[标记 timing_difference&lt;br/&gt;次日复核自动关闭]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[标记 unexplained&lt;br/&gt;进入人工调查队列]\n  F --&gt; K{跨系统汇总一致?}\n  K --&gt;|否| L[标记单边记账&lt;br/&gt;触发交易回溯]\n  K --&gt;|是| M[对账通过 → 写入日报]\n  M --&gt; N[按口径生成监管报送]</pre><h2 id=\"差异分类-三类来源与各自的处理\">差异分类：三类来源与各自的处理</h2><p>对账差异不是异常，而是常态。把差异按来源分类，可以让绝大部分差异自动关闭，把人力集中在真正的问题上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第一类-时间差\">第一类：时间差</h3><p><strong>时间差（timing difference）。</strong> 交易系统已记账但资金尚未到账，或反之。跨境场景下这类差异尤其常见，因为一笔跨境付款经过多层代理行，每一层都可能跨营业日。处理方式是在对账模型中引入<strong>在途科目</strong>——未到账的资金不视为缺口，而是记在「在途客户资金」这一独立科目下，并在次日自动复核关闭。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第二类-口径差\">第二类：口径差</h3><p><strong>口径差（definitional difference）。</strong> 双方对同一笔资金的归类不同，例如手续费是从客户资金中扣除还是由平台自有资金承担。这类差异必须通过<strong>统一口径的字典</strong>消除，而不是逐笔解释：把每一类交易的记账规则在两侧同时固定下来。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第三类-真实差错\">第三类：真实差错</h3><p><strong>真实差错（unexplained difference）。</strong> 无法由前两类解释的差异，包括漏记、重复记账、以及资金实际缺失。这类差异必须进入人工调查并追溯到具体交易，且要有明确的时限与升级路径。</p>\n<p>三类差异的工程含义完全不同：第一类需要的是<strong>在途科目的正确建模</strong>，第二类需要的是<strong>共享的记账口径定义</strong>，第三类需要的是<strong>可回溯到原始交易的对账明细</strong>。把它们混在一个「差异」数字里，是导致对账团队长期疲于奔命的主要原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账日报的数据模型\">对账日报的数据模型</h2><p>对账的产物应当是一份<strong>自证完整</strong>的日报：它不只记录结果，还记录能证明结果正确的中间量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE fund_reconciliation_daily (&#10;  recon_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  entity_id       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  currency        CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  business_date   DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  liability_open  NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  liability_credit NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  liability_debit NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  liability_close NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  asset_held      NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  in_transit      NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  gap             NUMERIC(20,4)&#10;                  GENERATED ALWAYS AS (asset_held + in_transit - liability_close) STORED,&#10;  status          TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                  CHECK (status IN (&#39;ok&#39;,&#39;open_discrepancy&#39;,&#39;investigating&#39;,&#39;escalated&#39;)),&#10;  closed_at       TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  CONSTRAINT complete_identity CHECK (&#10;    liability_close = liability_open + liability_credit - liability_debit&#10;  ),&#10;  CONSTRAINT uniq_unit_day UNIQUE (entity_id, currency, business_date)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE reconciliation_item (&#10;  item_id       BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  recon_id      BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES fund_reconciliation_daily(recon_id),&#10;  source_side   TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (source_side IN (&#39;ledger&#39;,&#39;bank&#39;,&#39;psp&#39;)),&#10;  source_ref    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  amount        NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  diff_class    TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                CHECK (diff_class IN (&#39;timing&#39;,&#39;definitional&#39;,&#39;unexplained&#39;)),&#10;  resolved      BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,&#10;  resolved_at   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  owner         TEXT&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_recon_open&#10;  ON fund_reconciliation_daily (status, business_date) WHERE status &lt;&gt; &#39;ok&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fund_reconciliation_daily</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recon_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  business_date   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  liability_open  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  liability_credit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  liability_debit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  liability_close </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_held      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  in_transit      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gap             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (asset_held </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_transit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> liability_close) STORED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ok'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'open_discrepancy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'investigating'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'escalated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closed_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> complete_identity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    liability_close </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> liability_open </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> liability_credit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> liability_debit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uniq_unit_day </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entity_id, currency, business_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reconciliation_item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  item_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recon_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fund_reconciliation_daily(recon_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_side   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (source_side </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ledger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bank'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'psp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  diff_class    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (diff_class </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'timing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'definitional'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unexplained'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolved      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolved_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_recon_open</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fund_reconciliation_daily (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, business_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ok'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个设计点。<code>gap</code> 用生成列（generated column）表达为 <code>asset_held + in_transit - liability_close</code>，把「在途资金计入可覆盖资产」这条口径直接写进 schema——这消除了口径差里最常见的一类分歧。<code>complete_identity</code> 约束保证完整性恒等式在写入时就成立，任何不满足的记录无法落库。<code>idx_recon_open</code> 是部分索引，让「所有未通过的对账单元当日未结」成为一个廉价查询，可以直接驱动运营看板。</p>\n<p><code>reconciliation_item.diff_class</code> 与 <code>owner</code> 的组合把差异处理变成可派工的任务流：<code>unexplained</code> 类差异必须有人负责，且这个人不是对账引擎的维护者而是业务侧能追溯原始交易的人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监管报送的口径设计\">监管报送的口径设计</h2><p>监管报送最常被做错的地方是<strong>报送数据与对账数据来源不同</strong>。如果报送是另一条单独的统计链路，那么两条链路的口径迟早会漂移，而监管检查时最常见的发现就是「你报给我们的数字和你自己的账对不上」。</p>\n<p>跨境业务还会在报送侧引入一层额外要求：监管越来越关注跨境支付链条上的<strong>数据完整性</strong>，因为它是反洗钱与制裁筛查的前提。行业层面推动的 ISO 20022 报文标准化正是为了解决同一笔跨境支付在不同机构间数据字段不一致的问题——国际清算银行支付与市场基础设施委员会在 2023 年 10 月发布的最终报告就提出跨境的 harmonised ISO 20022 数据要求，以支持更一致的跨境支付数据处理（<a href=\"https://www.bis.org/cpmi/publ/d215.htm\">BIS CPMI: ISO 20022 harmonisation requirements</a>）。对报送设计的含义是：如果支付报文本身字段不规范，对账与报送就需要在系统内做一层标准化映射，而不能假设上游数据天然对齐。</p>\n<p>正确做法是让报送成为对账账本的一个<strong>视图</strong>：报送所需的每个字段都必须能追溯到 <code>fund_reconciliation_daily</code> 与其明细，或者追溯到与之同源的交易表。这样做的直接好处是，当监管问「这个数字怎么来的」，答案是一条可执行的查询而不是一次人工统计。</p>\n<p>报送口径需要固化的字段通常包括：报送主体标识、报送期间与频率、每个指标的<strong>定义</strong>（含计入口径与排除项）、数据来源表、以及生成时点。把这些写成配置而不是散落在代码里，是让报送在监管口径变化时能快速调整的前提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"报送配置的形状\">报送配置的形状</h3><p>把上述字段固化成一份配置，可以让口径变化变成一次配置修改而不是一次代码发布。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"regulatory_report:&#10;  id: safeguarding_return_monthly&#10;  authority: local_regulator&#10;  entity: licensed_entity_A&#10;  period: monthly&#10;  due_rule: &#39;within N business days after period end&#39;&#10;  indicators:&#10;    - name: total_customer_fund_liability&#10;      definition: &#39;sum of all customer balances by currency, end of period&#39;&#10;      excludes: [&#39;internal_suspense_accounts&#39;, &#39;fee_accruals&#39;]&#10;      source_view: safeguarding_coverage&#10;    - name: eligible_safeguarding_asset&#10;      definition: &#39;sum of unencumbered safeguarding assets by currency, end of period&#39;&#10;      excludes: [&#39;encumbered_assets&#39;, &#39;assets_pledged_as_collateral&#39;]&#10;      source_view: safeguarding_coverage&#10;    - name: coverage_surplus&#10;      definition: &#39;eligible_safeguarding_asset - total_customer_fund_liability&#39;&#10;      source_view: safeguarding_coverage&#10;  evidence: [&#39;generated_report_file&#39;, &#39;generation_log&#39;, &#39;submitter_identity&#39;]&#10;  retention_years: &#39;per_regulator&#39;&#10;  owner: compliance_lead\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">regulatory_report</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">safeguarding_return_monthly</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  authority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">local_regulator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  entity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">licensed_entity_A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">monthly</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  due_rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'within N business days after period end'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  indicators</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">total_customer_fund_liability</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      definition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sum of all customer balances by currency, end of period'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      excludes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'internal_suspense_accounts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fee_accruals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      source_view</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">safeguarding_coverage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">eligible_safeguarding_asset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      definition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sum of unencumbered safeguarding assets by currency, end of period'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      excludes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'encumbered_assets'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'assets_pledged_as_collateral'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      source_view</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">safeguarding_coverage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">coverage_surplus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      definition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'eligible_safeguarding_asset - total_customer_fund_liability'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      source_view</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">safeguarding_coverage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  evidence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'generated_report_file'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'generation_log'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'submitter_identity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retention_years</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'per_regulator'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">compliance_lead</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>source_view: safeguarding_coverage</code> 这一行是整份配置的关键：三个指标全部来自 <a href=\"float-safeguard-segregation\">备付金/客户资金隔离存管</a> 中定义的对账视图，因此报送数字与内部对账数字在构造上必然一致。<code>excludes</code> 字段把排除项显式写出，让口径变化可被审查——监管口径调整时，改的是这一行，而不是散落在多个 SQL 里的条件。</p>\n<p>一个容易被忽略的报送要求是<strong>时间性与留痕</strong>：报送通常有固定截止日，且报送记录本身需要留存以备核查。这属于 <a href=\"../license-maintain-ops/license-renew-capital-require\">牌照续期/资本金/保证金维持</a> 中描述的周期性义务，应当纳入同一份义务台账统一管理，而不是作为财务部门的临时任务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>对账是验证<strong>三条恒等式</strong>：客户负债 = 存管资产（足额性）、期初+贷记−借记 = 期末（完整性）、交易侧汇总 = 资金侧汇总（一致性）；必须在<strong>主体 × 币种</strong>的核算单元粒度上成立。</li>\n<li>差异分三类：<strong>时间差</strong>（需要正确的在途科目建模）、<strong>口径差</strong>（需要共享的记账口径字典）、<strong>真实差错</strong>（需要可回溯到原始交易的对账明细）；混成一个数字是长期低效的根因。</li>\n<li>跨境场景下在途资金普遍存在，<code>gap</code> 应建模为 <code>asset + in_transit − liability</code>，把口径直接固化进 schema。</li>\n<li>用生成列、<code>CHECK</code> 约束与部分索引把「资金守恒」变成数据库层面的硬约束，让违规数据无法落库、未结单元可被廉价查询。</li>\n<li><strong>监管报送必须是对账账本的视图</strong>，而不是独立的统计链路；否则口径漂移会在检查时暴露为「报送数字与自身账目不一致」。</li>\n<li>报送的截止日与留痕要求应纳入统一义务台账，与续期、资本金维持一起管理——见 <a href=\"../license-maintain-ops/license-renew-capital-require\">牌照续期/资本金/保证金维持</a> 与 <a href=\"../license-maintain-ops/regulator-exam-remediation\">监管检查与整改</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"存管对账与监管报送","id":"存管对账与监管报送"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：对账的三条恒等式","id":"核心概念-对账的三条恒等式"},{"level":2,"text":"差异分类：三类来源与各自的处理","id":"差异分类-三类来源与各自的处理"},{"level":3,"text":"第一类：时间差","id":"第一类-时间差"},{"level":3,"text":"第二类：口径差","id":"第二类-口径差"},{"level":3,"text":"第三类：真实差错","id":"第三类-真实差错"},{"level":2,"text":"对账日报的数据模型","id":"对账日报的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"监管报送的口径设计","id":"监管报送的口径设计"},{"level":3,"text":"报送配置的形状","id":"报送配置的形状"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"资金池二清红线与不过平台路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-license-compliance/customer-fund-safeguard/no-pool-fund-two-clearing"},"next":{"title":"牌照续期/资本金/保证金维持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-license-compliance/license-maintain-ops/license-renew-capital-require"}}